# Personal eBird exports. These are a record of where someone has been and
# when -- never commit one, and never copy one into site/. The belt-and-braces
# rule: no CSV anywhere in the repo, since every CSV this project touches is
# either a personal export or a slice of the EBD.
MyEBirdData.csv
*_MyEBirdData.csv
ebird_*.csv
*.csv

